ype": "text", "content": "2.4 API文档"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 96, "bbox": [0.123, 0.849, 0.394, 0.864], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "官网:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://www.langchain.com/", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://www.langchain.com/"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 97, "bbox": [0.123, 0.876, 0.472, 0.891], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Github地址:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://github.com/langchain-ai", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://github.com/langchain-ai"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 98, "bbox": [0.123, 0.903, 0.711, 0.919], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "中文文档地址:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://docs.langchain.org.cn/oss/python/langchain/overview", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://docs.langchain.org.cn/oss/python/langchain/overview"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 99, "bbox": [0.122, 0.93, 0.697, 0.946], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "英文文档地址:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/overview", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/overview"}]}]}]}, {"page_idx": 8, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.122, 0.036, 0.66, 0.051], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "API文档查询地址:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://reference.langchain.com/python/langchain/", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://reference.langchain.com/python/langchain/"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.122, 0.091, 0.498, 0.116], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3、LangChain家族四大支柱"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.121, 0.128, 0.877, 0.164], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "截至2025年11月，LangChain 已从一"}, {"type": "text", "content": "个独立的开", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "发"}, {"type": "text", "content": "框架，成长为", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "一"}, {"type": "text", "content": "个覆盖智能体", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "系统"}, {"type": "text", "content": "全生命周期", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "的技术生态。该生态由四大核心支柱构成: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "LangChain LangGraph Deep Agent", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 与 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "LangSmith", "styles": ["underline"]}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.126, 0.174, 0.873, 0.459], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.126, 0.174, 0.873, 0.459], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.122, 0.471, 0.868, 0.506], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "它们分别对应基础能力层、运行时编排层、智能体抽象层、监控与评估层，共同构建了一个从技术验证到生产部署、从单体智能到复杂协作的项目闭环。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.123, 0.516, 0.251, 0.532], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "官方文档的解释:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.122, 0.544, 0.584, 0.56], "content": [{"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/concepts/products", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://docs.LangChain.com/oss/python/concepts/products"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.122, 0.574, 0.521, 0.596], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.1 LangChain:智能体开发的基石"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.122, 0.608, 0.869, 0.643], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain 是整个生态的核心与起点，为开发者提供了模型调用、工具与中间件集成、智能体构建等一整套基础能力。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.123, 0.653, 0.251, 0.669], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其核心价值如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.139, 0.68, 0.862, 0.714], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "统一的模型抽象层", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :屏蔽了不同模型服务提供商（如OpenAI、Anthropic、Ollama 等）的接口"}, {"type": "text", "content": "差异，提供一致的调", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "用方式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.14, 0.716, 0.849, 0.749], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "高度模块化的设计 :使用 Message、Tool、Agent、Middleware 等组件实现灵活的组合与扩展。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.139, 0.751, 0.784, 0.768], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "丰富的集成生态", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :预置了丰富的数据源、API、中间件等，构成了强大的AI能力枢纽。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.122, 0.779, 0.745, 0.796], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在整体架构中，LangChain 如同智能体的操作系统内核，是所有上层能力构建的基础。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.122, 0.805, 0.763, 0.823], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "结论:如果你需要构建简单的智能体应用，无需复杂的编排需求，那就选择LangChain。", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.122, 0.836, 0.577, 0.858], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.2 LangGraph:复杂工作流的编排引擎"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.122, 0.87, 0.81, 0.887], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当智能体的任务从单一指令执行扩展为多步骤、有状态的复杂工作流时，LangGraph应运而生。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.122, 0.898, 0.464, 0.915], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其核心思想是"}, {"type": "text", "content": "将智能体内部抽象为一张有向图", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.14, 0.925, 0.523, 0.941], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "节点（Node）", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :代表独立的功能单元或决策点。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.14, 0.943, 0.535, 0.959], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "边（Edge）", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :定义了节点之间的流转条件与路径。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 9, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.139, 0.035, 0.733, 0.052], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "状态（State）", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :作为一个共享上下文，在节点间传递并持久化存储任务信息。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.122, 0.062, 0.749, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通过这种图式结构，LangGraph 让智能体的工作流节点交互变得显式、可控、可观测。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.123, 0.089, 0.722, 0.107], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "官方也强调“快速起步用 LangChain，复杂控制用 LangGraph，二者并行协同”。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.123, 0.117, 0.201, 0.133], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通俗理解:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.132, 0.147, 0.869, 0.426], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.132, 0.147, 0.869, 0.426], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.146, 0.442, 0.724, 0.458], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain = 能力抽象层（LLM / Tool / Message 标准化），负责“有什么能力”"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.147, 0.469, 0.719, 0.486], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangGraph = 执行与编排层（状态机 / 工作流 / 多Agent系统），负责“怎么跑”"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.123, 0.499, 0.535, 0.521], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.3 Deep Agent:智能体的执行框架"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.123, 0.534, 0.859, 0.587], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Deep Agent 是新推出的全新组件，被定位为 Agent Harness（智能体执行框架）。它"}, {"type": "text", "content": "构建于", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "LangChain 与", "styles": ["bold", "underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "LangGraph 之上", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "，增加了规划能力、文件系统、子 Agent 等高级功能。旨在让开发者"}, {"type": "text", "content": "无须从零构建", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 复杂的控制逻辑，即可创建具备深度规划、长期记忆与多专家协作能力的智能体。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.123, 0.596, 0.344, 0.613], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Deep Agent 的核心能力如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.139, 0.624, 0.563, 0.64], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "显式规划 :自", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "主生成、执行并动态调整多步任务计划。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.14, 0.642, 0.612, 0.657], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "虚拟文件系统", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :为智能体提供结构化的中间结果与知识存储。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.14, 0.66, 0.564, 0.675], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "子智能体", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :支持任务在多个智能体之间的分解与协作。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.139, 0.678, 0.705, 0.693], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "长期记忆 :通", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "过与 LangGraph 状态存储的结合，实现跨对话的经验积累。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.14, 0.695, 0.645, 0.711], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "可扩展中间件", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :允许嵌入安全审计、性能监控或自定义业务逻辑。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.123, 0.752, 0.295, 0.773], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.4 三者的关系"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.122, 0.787, 0.763, 0.803], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "官方文档（三者对比）:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/overview", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/overview"}]}]}]}, {"page_idx": 10, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.157, 0.04, 0.827, 0.176], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain is the easy way to start building completely custom agents and applications powered by LLMs. With under 10 lines of code, you can connect to OpenAl, Anthropic, Google, and more. LangChain provides a prebuilt agent architecture and model integrations to help you get started quickly and seamlessly incorporate LLMs into your agents and applications."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.183, 0.206, 0.568, 0.226], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain vs. LangGraph vs. Deep Agents"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.213, 0.238, 0.781, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "If you are looking to build an agent, we recommend you start with Deep Agents which comes “batteries-included\", with modern features like automatic compression of long conversations, a virtual filesystem, and subagent-spawning for managing and isolating context."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.214, 0.319, 0.803, 0.371], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Deep Agents are implementations of LangChain agents. If you don't need these capabilities or would like to customize your own for your agents and autonomous applications, start with LangChain."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.214, 0.383, 0.803, 0.435], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use LangGraph, our low-level agent orchestration framework and runtime, when you have more advanced needs that require a combination of deterministic and agentic workflows and heavy customization."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.122, 0.469, 0.644, 0.487], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "三个框架不是竞争关系，并非互斥，复杂项目完全可以同时用到这三层。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.122, 0.496, 0.335, 0.513], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "基于LLM的应用开发体系图:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.125, 0.52, 0.875, 0.811], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.125, 0.52, 0.875, 0.811], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.12, 0.821, 0.866, 0.856], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从 LangChain 快速搭建，用 LangGraph 打磨生产稳定性，再用 Deep Agents 赋予 Agent 更强的自主能力——这才是完整的 LangChain 生态玩法。"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.822, 0.799, 0.876, 0.811], "content": []}]}, {"page_idx": 11, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.123, 0.036, 0.573, 0.058], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.5 LangSmith:可视化监控与测试平台"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.122, 0.071, 0.829, 0.088], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当智能体系统逐渐复杂时，单靠日志与打印输出（print）调试已无法满足调试与质量管理的需求。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.122, 0.098, 0.875, 0.133], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangSmith 是 LangChain 官方推出的 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "可视化监控与测试平台", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，"}, {"type": "text", "content": "用于跟踪、记录和分析智能体在运行过程中的完整调用链路", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "，让智能体的内部运行过程变得透明和可评估。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.128, 0.143, 0.876, 0.384], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.128, 0.143, 0.876, 0.384], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.123, 0.394, 0.337, 0.41], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangSmith 的核心目标如下:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.139, 0.42, 0.743, 0.437], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "全链路追踪", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :可视化追踪模型调用、提示词输入、结果输出、工具使用等行为。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.14, 0.439, 0.581, 0.454], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "调试与优化 :发", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "现运行中智能体的异常行为与性能瓶颈。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.14, 0.456, 0.612, 0.472], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "评测与质量控制", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :支持人工与自动化评测，量化智能体表现。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.14, 0.474, 0.498, 0.49], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "团队协作", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " :支持多人共享测试集与调用记录。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.123, 0.502, 0.552, 0.518], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangSmith官网:"}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://www.langchain.com/langsmith", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "https://www.langchain.com/langsmith"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.122, 0.528, 0.664, 0.546], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangSmith 的引入使得智能体的开发、调试与运维形成了完整的质量闭环。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.122, 0.557, 0.405, 0.582], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4、开发前的准备工作"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.123, 0.595, 0.27, 0.616], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.1 前置知识"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.123, 0.63, 0.284, 0.646], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1、Python 基础语法"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.139, 0.657, 0.562, 0.673], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "变量、流程控制、函数与参数机制、类与对象、装饰器"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.14, 0.675, 0.633, 0.69], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "常用的容器（列表、元组、集合、字"}, {"type": "text", "content": "典）、J", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "SON处理、异常处理"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.14, 0.693, 0.611, 0.709], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "模块导入、包管理（推荐用 pip 或 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "conda", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " ） 、线程与协程"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.145, 0.72, 0.77, 0.755], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain 生态支持包括 Python 和 JavaScript 语言实现。其中，Python 版本仍是功能最完整、更新最及时、社区最活跃的核心实现。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.122, 0.764, 0.272, 0.781], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2、大语言模型基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.14, 0.793, 0.528, 0.808], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "了解什么是 LLM、Token、Prompt、Embedding"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.14, 0.81, 0.71, 0.826], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "OpenAI API 或其他模型提供商，如 Anthropic、阿里云百炼、DeepSeek等"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.14, 0.828, 0.658, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通过浏览器或app使用过大模型（比如:豆包、千问、DeepSeek等）"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 12, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.123, 0.036, 0.319, 0.057], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.2 相关环境安装"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.123, 0.071, 0.306, 0.089], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.2.1 代码管理方案"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.122, 0.102, 0.864, 0.137], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "相较于 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "全局环境（系统环境）", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，各个 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "虚拟环境", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都有自己独立的一套:Python 解释器、pip 命令、第三方依赖包，不和其它项目产生干扰。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.125, 0.146, 0.874, 0.443], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.125, 0.146, 0.874, 0.443], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_footnote", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.123, 0.456, 0.284, 0.471], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "虚拟环境的设置方案:"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.122, 0.482, 0.6, 0.499], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "方案1-使用conda:适合“Python + 非 Python 依赖”的复杂环境", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.122, 0.51, 0.869, 0.545], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "conda 不只"}, {"type": "text", "content": "是 Python 包管理工具，它还可以管理 Python 解释器、P", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "ython 包，以及很多非 Python 依赖，比如: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CUDA、编译器、系统库、数据库驱动、科学计算底层库", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 等非 Python 依赖。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.122, 0.554, 0.748, 0.571], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "因此在数据科学、深度学习、AI 工程、科学计算等场景中，conda 更稳妥、优先推荐。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.122, 0.581, 0.865, 0.615], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "conda 环境中可以使用 pip，但建议先用 conda 装底层依赖，再用 pip 补充 Python 包，不要随意反复交替使用", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.146, 0.626, 0.274, 0.643], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "本套课程的选择。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.122, 0.681, 0.509, 0.698], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "方案2-使用uv:适合“纯 Python 项目”的现代包管理"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.122, 0.708, 0.869, 0.742], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "uv 是一个现代 Python 包管理工具，主要 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "管理 Python 生态依赖", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，不能像 conda 那样管理 CUDA、系统级数据库驱动、编译器这类通用非 Python 依赖。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.123, 0.752, 0.665, 0.769], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果项目主要是普通 Python 开发，这类项目通常可以"}, {"type": "text", "content": "优先考虑 uv", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "。例如:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.143, 0.788, 0.33, 0.886], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1 FastAPI "}, {"type": "text", "content": "项目", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "2 LangChain "}, {"type": "text", "content": "项目", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "3 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "脚本工具", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "4 Web "}, {"type": "text", "content": "后端", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "5 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "普通", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " AI Agent "}, {"type": "text", "content": "应用", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "6 RAG "}, {"type": "text", "content": "应用层代码", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.123, 0.935, 0.525, 0.951], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "方案3-使用venv:Python 自带的轻量级虚拟环境工具"}], "level": 2}]}, {"page_idx": 13, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.127, 0.035, 0.578, 0.052], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "venv", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 Python 官方自带的虚拟环境工具，不需要额外安装。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.124, 0.062, 0.299, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "它的特点是简单、轻量:"}]}, {"type": "code", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.145, 0.099, 0.358, 0.116], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.145, 0.099, 0.358, 0.116], "content": "1 python -m venv .venv"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "batch"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.122, 0.137, 0.856, 0.172], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ": venv 不负责安装新的 Python 解释器，只能基于当前已经安装好的 Python 解释器创建虚拟环境。同时，venv 也不负责管理 CUDA、系统库等非 Python 依赖。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.123, 0.209, 0.201, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "三者对比:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "table", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.125, 0.239, 0.874, 0.446], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.125, 0.239, 0.874, 0.446], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>工具</td><td>管理 Python 解释器</td><td>管理Python包</td><td>管理非Python 依赖</td><td>适合场景</td></tr><tr><td>conda</td><td>✅可以</td><td>✅可以</td><td>✅可以</td><td>AI、深度学习、科学计算、复杂底层依赖(C/C++，CUDA)</td></tr><tr><td>uv</td><td>✅可以</td><td>✅可以</td><td>❌不可以</td><td>纯 Python 项目、Web、Agent、RAG 应用层</td></tr><tr><td>venv</td><td>不支持原生安装，基于已有解释器</td><td>✅可以</td><td>❌不可以</td><td>简单项目、教学演示、轻量隔离</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.122, 0.462, 0.808, 0.479], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于LangChain这样的纯Python环境，可以用uv，也可以用conda。本套课程选择使用conda。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.123, 0.49, 0.561, 0.507], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "安装conda环境，见 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "《02资料\\尚硅谷-conda使用指南.md》", "styles": ["underline"]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.123, 0.516, 0.507, 0.534], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "普通 Python 项目:可以用 uv，速度快，体验好。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.123, 0.546, 0.46, 0.565], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.2.2 安装虚拟环境与Python解释器"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.122, 0.577, 0.875, 0.612], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain基于Python开发，因此需确保系统中安装了Python解释器，我们在创建虚拟环境过程中安装Python解释器。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.123, 0.623, 0.768, 0.64], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain 1.2版本要求Python版本为 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "3.10+以上", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，这里我们使用 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "python3.13.12", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 版本。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.145, 0.649, 0.667, 0.666], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意:如下包的安装，必须显式指明版本，否则可能会出现不兼容情况。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.124, 0.676, 0.277, 0.693], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1、创建conda环境:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "code", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.153, 0.712, 0.65, 0.962], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.153, 0.712, 0.65, 0.962], "content": "1 #创建一个名为langchain1.2的环境，指定Python版本是3.13.12\n2 conda create --name langchain1.2 python=3.13.12\n3\n4 #查看anconda安装好的python环境\n5 conda env list\n6\n7 #初始化虚拟环境 (执行完此指令，重新启动命令行窗口)\n8 conda init\n9\n10 #在命令行窗口切换到某python环境\n11 conda activate langchain1.2\n12\n13 #验证python版本\n14 (langchain1.2) C:\\Users\\shkstart>python -V\n15 #或 调用：python --version"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "txt"}]}, {"page_idx": 14, "blocks": [{"type": "code", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.152, 0.032, 0.374, 0.051], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.152, 0.032, 0.374, 0.051], "content": "16 #输出：Python 3.12.13"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "txt"}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.123, 0.07, 0.316, 0.089], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2、退出/删除conda环境:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "code", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.145, 0.105, 0.59, 0.192], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.145, 0.105, 0.59, 0.192], "content": "1 #在命令行退出当前python环境\n2\n3 (langchain1.2) C:\\Users\\shkst>conda deactivate\n4 #删除一个已有的anconda管理的python环境\n5 conda remove --name langchain1.2 --all"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "txt"}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.123, 0.238, 0.384, 0.259], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.2.3 下载langchain安装包"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.128, 0.269, 0.369, 0.289], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "方式1:使用conda指令", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " （推荐）"}]}, {"type": "code", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.152, 0.306, 0.608, 0.583], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.152, 0.306, 0.608, 0.583], "content": "1 # 安装指定版本。比如1.2.2\n2 conda install langchain==1.2.12\n3 # 或者安装最新版（默认仓库）\n4 conda install langchain\n5\n6\n7 # 指定频道（如 conda-forge）\n8 conda install -c conda-forge langchain==1.2.12\n9\n10 # 更新包\n11 conda update langchain\n12\n13 # 卸载包\n14 conda uninstall langchain\n15\n16 # 查看已安装包\n17 conda list"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "txt"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.148, 0.602, 0.476, 0.619], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "conda 包通常来自 defaults 或 conda-forge。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.15, 0.627, 0.61, 0.647], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "-c 是 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "--channel", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的缩写，conda用于指定包的安装来源渠道。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.153, 0.656, 0.554, 0.674], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "conda-forge", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 该源比官方默认渠道更新更快、包更全"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.129, 0.71, 0.284, 0.729], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "方式2:使用pip指令"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "code", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.151, 0.745, 0.849, 0.964], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.151, 0.745, 0.849, 0.964], "content": "1 # 安装指定版本\n2 pip install langchain==1.2.12\n3 #安装最新版（不推荐）：pip install langchain\n4\n5 # 使用指定源：国内镜像加速 （解决下载慢） -i：指定镜像源\n6 pip install langchain==1.2.12 -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple\n7\n8 # 从旧版本升级到新版本\n9 pip install --upgrade langchain\n10 #或者 pip install -U langchain==1.2.12\n11\n12 # 卸载包\n13 pip uninstall langchain"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "shell"}]}, {"page_idx": 15, "bloc